    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d583">

                <pb facs="0657" n="399" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg399"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 341.115P51/54</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1915</hi>.</date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.30 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2122. My 1998, April 27, and 2029, May 4, re <hi rendition="#italic">Joseph W.
                        Fordney</hi>.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d583-f1"/> Replying to my representations
                    Foreign Office informs me:</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>Apart from the uncertainty of the address of the consignee of the cargo of
                        this vessel, Mr. E. Klingener, His Majesty’s Government have evidence that
                        the cargo was not destined for <hi rendition="#italic">bona-fide</hi>
                        Swedish consumption, but was intended for Germany, and that the proper
                        course of the consignees is to make application to the prize court.</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Ambassador</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
